                                "example_id": "c975d0da-d176-4ecf-9afa-d3b953bd622b",
                                "sense_id": "34576748-92a3-3968-b68b-a9c43970f606",
                                "text": "Well, mayhap that'll do, as it's a little gell, for they're easier persuaded to sit i' one place nor the lads."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "54404725-5f87-4217-b531-7fc71de2e08e",
                                "sense_id": "34576748-92a3-3968-b68b-a9c43970f606",
                                "text": "\"You're a naughty little gell, that's what you are,\" said the fireman, and the engine-driver said:--\n\"Daring little piece, I call her,\" but they made her sit down on an iron seat in the cab and told her to stop crying and tell them what she meant by it."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
